 a knight clad in heavy armor? With over 180 items there are interesting build choices and playstyles for every player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317660/extras/f3d9b5efc5bccd736466510cc72ccbfb.poster.avif?t=1772564828\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317660/extras/f3d9b5efc5bccd736466510cc72ccbfb.webm?t=1772564828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317660/extras/f3d9b5efc5bccd736466510cc72ccbfb.mp4?t=1772564828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317660/extras/6fa158ada83bd68768bfc4072628fd30.avif?t=1772564828\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a randomly generated dark medieval world filled with madness. Unravel the mystery behind the disappearance of the Sun or fade into the darkness. You are not alone. There\u2019s always something lurking in the dark behind every fork in the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317660/extras/bfd4d32cacd403f4e9a26848d5d4e3f5.poster.avif?t=1772564828\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317660/extras/bfd4d32cacd403f4e9a26848d5d4e3f5.webm?t=1772564828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317660/extras/bfd4d32cacd403f4e9a26848d5d4e3f5.mp4?t=177256